    /* the helmet: a white shell open at the face, its mission stripes running up the back and over the top with the ꜩ on the back, a sealed visor, a gold sun visor raised over the brow, comms pods at the temples, a lamp and an antenna; a locking ring at its base over the suit's collar; and its own ears, which hold the cat's */
